      "id": "0d78e334ff6c4bca",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -15019,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**假设检验的目标 (Objective of Hypothesis Testing)**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2f10fa551e8456c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -15019,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**偏差矩阵（Deviation Matrix）的定义**"
    },
    {
      "id": "ebe69d4f1acf4bce",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -14909,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**偏度与峰度检验 (Skewness and Kurtosis Test)**"
    },
    {
      "id": "8fa00400e7df4c08",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -14909,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**充分统计量**"
    },
    {
      "id": "d8ce79aad8ff49d5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -14909,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**先估计参数$\\theta$，再对估计结果$\\hat{\\theta}$做函数变换$h(\\hat{\\theta})$**"
    },
    {
      "id": "4a161ff7a6f3430d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -14799,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**先对$\\theta$做函数变换$h(\\theta)$，再对$h(\\theta)$做最大似然估计**"
    },
    {
      "id": "b06bb3bf21ae4b5b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -14799,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**先验概率**"
    },
